<%args>
$locations
</%args>

<div class="modal fade" id="create_cross" name="create_cross" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="createNewCrossesDialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content ui-front">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
                <h4 class="modal-title" id="createNewCrosses">新增雜交(Add New Cross)</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="container-fluid">

                    <&| /util/workflow.mas, id=> "add_cross_workflow" &>
                        <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=> "介紹(Intro)" &>
                            <& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"什麼是雜交？(What is a Cross?)" &>

                            <ul>
                                <li>雜交工具可以追蹤育種計畫中的任何授粉。</li>
                                <li>每個雜交都有一個全域唯一的雜交 ID。</li>
                                <li>支援的雜交類型為：雙親 (biparental)、自交 (self)、開放授粉 (open)、回交 (backcross)、同胞交 (sib)、多系交配 (polycross)、混合 (bulk)、混合自交 (bulk_self)、混合開放 (bulk_open) 或單倍體加倍 (doubled_haploid)</li>
                                <li>對於開放授粉雜交，雜交可以定義為母本種原 A 與父本族群 P1 之間（資料庫中的族群嚴格定義為種原群組）。如果父本未知，可以留空。</li>
                                <li>對於回交類型，雜交唯一 ID 可以作為親本之一。</li>
                                <li>單個雜交可以連結到特定的母本小區或植株，以及特定的父本小區或植株。</li>
                                <li>雜交可以關聯其他資料，例如花朵數量、授粉日期等。</li>
                                <li>雜交產生的種子可以使用種子批次進行管理。</li>
                                <li>雜交的後代可以成為資料庫中已命名的種原。</li>
                            </ul>

                            <br/>
                            <center>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">前往下一步(Go to Next Step)</button>
                            </center>
                        </&>
                        <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=> "雜交實驗(Crossing Experiment)" &>
                            <& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"選擇雜交實驗(Select a Crossing Experiment)" &>

                            <p>雜交實驗用於將雜交分組在一起。分組通常針對來自同一個田間試驗、同一年份或具有相同育種目標的雜交進行。</p>
                            <center>
                                <button class="btn btn-info" name="create_crossingtrial_link">若您需要建立雜交實驗，請點選此處(If you need to create a crossing experiment, click here)</button><br/><br/>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">當您已建立雜交實驗後，前往下一步(Once You Have a Crossing Experiment, Go to Next Step)</button>
                            </center>

                        </&>

                        <form class="form-horizontal" role="form" name="create_cross_form" id="create_cross_form">

                            <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=> "輸入雜交資訊(Enter Cross Information)" &>
                                <& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"輸入雜交基本資訊(Enter Basic Information About the Cross)" &>

                                <&| /page/explanation.mas, title=>'雜交類型資訊(Cross Type Information)' &>
                                    <p>
                                        <b>雜交類型資訊</b>
                                        <br>
                                        <a id="cross_type_info">雜交類型說明(Descriptions of Cross Types)</a>
                                    </p>
                                </&>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">育種計畫：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <div id="add_cross_breeding_program_select_div" name="add_cross_breeding_program_select_div">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div><br/><br/><br/>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">雜交實驗：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <div id="add_cross_crossing_experiment_select_div" name="add_cross_crossing_experiment_select_div" >
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div><br/><br/>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">雜交唯一 ID：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <input class="form-control" type="text" id="cross_name" name="cross_name" />
                                    </div>
                                </div><br/><br/>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">雜交組合 (選填)：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <input class="form-control" type="text" id="dialog_cross_combination" name="dialog_cross_combination" placeholder="例如：female_name/male_name"/>
                                    </div>
                                </div><br/><br/>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">雜交類型：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <select class="form-control" id="cross_type">
                                            <option value="">選擇雜交類型</option>
                                            <option value="biparental">雙親 (biparental)</option>
                                            <option value="self">自交 (self)</option>
                                            <option value="open">開放授粉 (open pollinated)</option>
                                            <option value="backcross">回交 (backcross)</option>
                                            <option value="sib">同胞交 (sib)</option>
                                            <option value="bulk">混合 (bulk)</option>
                                            <option value="bulk_self">混合自交 (bulk selfed)</option>
                                            <option value="bulk_open">混合與開放授粉 (bulk and open pollinated)</option>
                                            <option value="doubled_haploid">單倍體加倍 (doubled haploid)</option>
                                            <option value="polycross">多系交配 (polycross)</option>
                                            <option value="reciprocal">正反交 (reciprocal)</option>
                                            <option value="multicross">多元雜交 (multicross)</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <br/><br/>
                                <center>
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">前往下一步(Go to Next Step)</button>
                                </center>
                            </&>
                            <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=> "輸入親本資訊(Enter Parentage Information)" &>
                                <& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"輸入雜交基本資訊(Enter Basic Information About the Cross)" &>

                                <div class="form-group" id="get_maternal_parent" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">母本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="maternal_parent" type="text" name="maternal" placeholder="輸入母本名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_paternal_parent" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">父本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="paternal_parent" type="text" name="paternal" placeholder="輸入父本名稱"  />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_selfed_parent" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">自交親本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="selfed_parent" type="text" name="selfed" placeholder="輸入親本名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_open_maternal_parent" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">母本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="open_maternal_parent" type="text" name="open maternal" placeholder="輸入母本名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_open_paternal_population" style="display: none">
                                    <div class="col-sm-2"><center><label class="control-label">父本族群：</label><i>(選填)</i></center></div>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="open_paternal_population" type="text" name="open paternal" placeholder="輸入父本族群名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_bulk_maternal_population" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">母本族群：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="bulk_maternal_population" type="text" name="bulk maternal" placeholder="輸入母本族群名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_bulk_paternal_parent" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">父本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="bulk_paternal_parent" type="text" name="bulk paternal" placeholder="輸入父本名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_bulk_selfed_population" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">自交族群：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="bulk_selfed_population" type="text" name="bulk selfed" placeholder="輸入親本族群名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_bulk_open_maternal_population" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">母本族群：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="bulk_open_maternal_population" type="text" name="bulk open maternal" placeholder="輸入母本族群名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_bulk_open_paternal_population" style="display: none">
                                    <div class="col-sm-2"><center><label class="control-label">父本族群：</label><i>(選填)</i></center></div>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="bulk_open_paternal_population" type="text" name="bulk open paternal" placeholder="輸入父本族群名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="get_doubled_haploid_parent" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">單倍體加倍親本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="doubled_haploid_parent" type="text" name="doubled haploid" placeholder="輸入親本名稱" />
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="polycross_accessions" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">多系交配使用的種原：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <div id="polycross_accession_list"></div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="reciprocal_accessions" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">正反交使用的種原：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <div id="reciprocal_accession_list"></div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="maternal_accessions" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">多元雜交母本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <div id="maternal_accession_list"></div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="paternal_accessions" style="display: none">
                                    <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">多元雜交父本：</label>
                                    <div class="col-sm-10">
                                        <div id="paternal_accession_list"></div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group" id="exact_parents" style="display: none">
                                    <& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"選填：若您選擇記錄確切的雜交親本，可以在此記錄。(Optional: If you choose to record exact cross parents, you can do so.)" &>

                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">田間試驗：</label>
                                        <div class="col-sm-10">
                                            <div class="input-group">
                                                <input type ="text" class ="form-control" id ="field_trial" placeholder="輸入試驗名稱">
                                                <div class ="input-group-btn">
                                                    <button class = "btn btn-info" id ="search_plots"></i>搜尋小區(Search Plots)</button>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">母本小區：</label>
                                        <div class="col-sm-10">
                                            <select class="form-control" id="female_plot" name="female_plot">
                                                <option value="">請先輸入試驗名稱</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label class="col-sm-2 control-label">父本小區：</label>
                                        <div class="col-sm-10">
                                            <select class="form-control" id="male_plot" name="male_plot">
                                                <option value="">請先輸入試驗名稱</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                    </div><br/><br/>
                                </div>
                                <br>
                                <center>
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">前往下一步(Go to Next Step)</button>
                                </center>
                            </&>
                            <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=> "附加雜交資訊(Additional Cross Info)" &>
                                <& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"若您想為此雜交新增自動產生的後代名稱，可以在此新增(If you would like to add auto-generated progeny names for this cross, you can add it here)" &>
                                <h3>選填：</h3>
                                <table>
