</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="cross_type_dialog" name="cross_type_dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="crossTypeDialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
                <h4 class="modal-title" id="crossTypeDialog">範本資訊(Template Information)</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="container-fluid">
                    <h2>
                        個別雜交：
                    </h2>

                    <p><b>雙親 (biparental)：</b>單一植株由另一單一植株授粉。<p>
                    <p><b>自交 (self)：</b>單一自花授粉植株。<p>
                    <p><b>開放授粉 (open pollinated)：</b>單一植株由一組植株授粉或開放授粉（花粉可能來自已知或未知成員的群組）。<p>
                    <p><b>回交 (backcross)：</b>單一植株由其親本之一授粉。<p>
                    <p><b>同胞交 (sib)：</b>至少具有一個共同親本的個體之間的交配。通常在同一個小區內的兩個個體之間進行。<p>
                    <p><b>混合 (bulk)：</b>一組植株（通常是相關家族）由單一植株授粉。<p>
                    <p><b>混合自交 (bulk selfed)：</b>一組自花授粉的植株（通常是相關家族）（每個個體自交，非混合花粉）。<p>
                    <p><b>混合與開放授粉 (bulk and open pollinated)：</b>一組植株（通常是相關家族）由另一組植株授粉或開放授粉（花粉可能來自已知或未知成員的群組）。<p>
                    <p><b>單倍體加倍 (doubled haploid)：</b>由單倍體組織染色體加倍衍生的植株。<p>
                    <br>

                    <h2>
                      群組雜交：
                    </h2>

                    <p><b>多系交配 (polycross)：</b>建立一組開放授粉雜交。所選清單中的每個種原都會成為開放雜交中的母本，並且清單中的所有成員組合在一起形成父本。<p>
                    <p><b>正反交 (reciprocal)：</b>建立一組雙親雜交。從種原清單開始，在它們之間進行所有可能的雙親雜交組合。<p>
                    <p><b>多元雜交 (multicross)：</b>建立一組雙親雜交。從母本種原清單和父本種原清單開始，依序進行直接雜交。<p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">關閉(Close)</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="cross_saved_dialog_message" name="cross_saved_dialog_message" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="crossSavedDialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="crossSavedDialog">成功(Success)</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
	    <p>
    	  <span class="ui-icon ui-icon-circle-check" style="float: left; margin: 0 7px 50px 0;"></span>
    	  雜交已成功儲存。
  	  </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button id="dismiss_cross_saved_dialog" type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">關閉(Close)</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>

jQuery.noConflict();

jQuery(document).ready(function($) {

    jQuery("#field_trial").autocomplete({
        source:'/ajax/stock/project_autocomplete',
    });

    $("#search_plots").click(function(e){
        e.preventDefault();

        var maternal_parent;
        if ($('#maternal_parent').val() != ''){
            maternal_parent = $('#maternal_parent').val();
        }

        if ($('#selfed_parent').val() != ''){
            maternal_parent = $('#selfed_parent').val();
        }

        if ($('#open_maternal_parent').val() != ''){
            maternal_parent = $('#open_maternal_parent').val();
        }

        console.log(maternal_parent);

        jQuery.ajax({
            url:'/ajax/breeders/get_accession_plots',
            data:{'field_trial':$('#field_trial').val(),
                  'parent_accession':maternal_parent,
                  },
            success: function(response){
            console.log(response);
            var html = '<select id = "female_plot" >';
            for (var i=0; i<response.data.length; i++) {
            html = html + "<option value='"+response.data[i][0]+ "'>" + response.data[i][1] + "</option>";
            }
            html = html + "</select>";
            console.log(html);

            if(i ==''){
            alert("無母本小區");
            return;
            }

            jQuery('#female_plot').html(html);

            },
            error:function(response){
            alert("取得母本小區時發生錯誤。");
            }
        });

        var paternal_parent;

        if ($('#paternal_parent').val() != ''){
        paternal_parent = $('#paternal_parent').val();
        }

        if ($('#selfed_parent').val() != ''){
        paternal_parent = $('#selfed_parent').val();
        }

        jQuery.ajax({
            url:'/ajax/breeders/get_accession_plots',
            data:{'field_trial':$('#field_trial').val(),
                  'parent_accession':paternal_parent,
                  },
            success: function(response){
            console.log(response);
            var html = '<select id = "male_plot" >';
            for (var i=0; i<response.data.length; i++) {
            html = html + "<option value='"+response.data[i][0]+ "'>" + response.data[i][1] + "</option>";
            }
            html = html + "</select>";
            console.log(html);

            if(i ==''){
            alert("無父本小區");
            return;
            }

            jQuery('#male_plot').html(html);

            },
        });
    });
});

</script>
